cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use TREC-SAR in research, please cite it as below."
title: "TREC-SAR: link-aware search planning for rescue ground robots"
abstract: >
  Open-source search planner and simulation stack for a tracked rescue UGV working with a drone. It plans search
  goals, radio-relay placement and time-bounded link-loss windows from a Bayesian probability map, and is
  evaluated on time until the command post receives the casualty report.
authors:
  - family-names: "Khan"
    given-names: "Mustafa R."
version: 0.2.0
date-released: 2026-10-12
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/mustafarkhan/trec-sar"
keywords:
  - search and rescue
  - robotics
  - unmanned ground vehicle
  - Bayesian search
  - communication-aware planning
  - ROS 2
